ry","children":"A transparent flat management fee — not a % of your ad spend. Campaign management, optimization, and reporting. You pay the ad platforms directly and keep full control."}]]}],["$","li","Audit & setup",{"className":"flex flex-col rounded-xl border p-6 border-hairline bg-white/[0.015]","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label-s uppercase [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label-tight)] text-fg-muted","children":"Fixed scope · one-time"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-3 font-display text-display-s font-bold text-fg","children":"Audit & setup"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-mono text-body-sm text-fg-secondary","children":"A one-time account audit + clean campaign build with a costed roadmap — fix wasted spend and launch right."}]]}],["$","li","Paid + SEO",{"className":"flex flex-col rounded-xl border p-6 border-hairline bg-white/[0.015]","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label-s uppercase [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label-tight)] text-fg-muted","children":"Full-funnel · bundled"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-3 font-display text-display-s font-bold text-fg","children":"Paid + SEO"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-mono text-body-sm text-fg-secondary","children":"Bundle paid media with SEO — buy visibility now while organic compounds. One team, one strategy."}]]}]]}]]}]
